---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ConversionHero from '../components/ConversionHero.astro';
import TrustStrip from '../components/TrustStrip.astro';
import ConsultationCTA from '../components/ConsultationCTA.astro';
import StickyBookButton from '../components/StickyBookButton.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Rodrigo Silva — CBT & CAT Therapy in Jersey"
  description="Private therapy in Jersey with Rodrigo Silva — BABCP CBT and ACAT CAT. Reformulation letters, behavioural experiments. I don't promise to fix anything.">
  <Nav />

  <ConversionHero
    eyebrow="CBT & CAT Psychotherapy · St Helier, Jersey · Online across UK and Europe"
    headline="Evidence-based therapy for the patterns that don't shift on their own."
    subhead="Private psychotherapy in Saint Helier and online — BABCP-accredited (CBT), ACAT-accredited (CAT)." />

  <TrustStrip />

  <!-- Approach teaser -->
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-xs tracking-trust uppercase text-subtle-text">How I work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl text-warm-black">
      Two structured routes.
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-warm-black">Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT)</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-subtle-text">Change the way you think, change the way you feel.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-body-text leading-relaxed">
        CBT works on the link between your thoughts, feelings, and behaviour. It's
        practical and focused on the present — we look at what's keeping a problem
        going and work out, step by step, how to shift it, through collaborative
        formulation and behavioural experiments. Structured, time-limited, and
        proven to help with anxiety and low mood.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-warm-black">Cognitive Analytic Therapy (CAT)</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-subtle-text">Understand why it keeps happening. Recognise the pattern. Change it.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-body-text leading-relaxed">
        Some difficulties aren't about a single thought or habit — they're patterns
        that repeat, often learned early in life and replayed in how we treat
        ourselves and relate to others. CAT helps you see those patterns clearly
        and step out of them. Early on, I write you a reformulation letter — your
        patterns set out in your own story — and together we map them on paper so
        you can spot them as they happen. It's collaborative and time-limited,
        usually around 16 sessions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/approach" class="mt-8 inline-block text-warm-black underline underline-offset-4">
      Read more about my approach →
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- Conditions teaser -->
  <section class="bg-muted-cream py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-trust uppercase text-subtle-text">What I treat</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl text-warm-black">
        Common reasons people come to see me.
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 text-body-text">
        <li>Relationship Issues</li>
        <li>Anxiety</li>
        <li>Anger Management</li>
        <li>Behavioural Issues</li>
        <li>Depression</li>
        <li>Self Esteem</li>
        <li>Excessive Worry</li>
        <li>Obsessions and Compulsions</li>
        <li>Emotional Dysregulation</li>
        <li>Sleep Difficulties</li>
        <li>Work Stress</li>
        <li>Trauma</li>
        <li>Conflict</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/what-i-treat" class="mt-8 inline-block text-warm-black underline underline-offset-4">
        See the full list →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing CTA -->
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-warm-black">
      The free 15-minute call is for triage, not therapy. You describe what's
      bringing you; I say what I think we can do together. If I'm not the right
      person, I'll say so.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6"><ConsultationCTA /></div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
      <a href="/fees" class="text-warm-black underline underline-offset-4">See fees and how sessions work →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
  <StickyBookButton />
</BaseLayout>
